Time (UTC)	Event	Source
06:19:54	root login from 203.101.190.9 (unrelated)	auth.log
06:31:31	MaxStartups throttling begins	auth.log
06:31:33–42	48 failed passwords from 65.2.161.68	auth.log
06:31:40	Automated root login succeeds (session 34, no terminal)	auth.log
06:32:44	Manual root login (session 37)	auth.log
